{"type":"standard","title":"Zack Mullock","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Zack Mullock</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q131752057","titles":{"canonical":"Zack_Mullock","normalized":"Zack Mullock","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Zack Mullock</span></span>"},"pageid":84628942,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383735944","tid":"d062fc53-d85a-11f1-ab9b-117b85dfd7b5","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:19:58Z","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zack_Mullock","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zack_Mullock?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zack_Mullock?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Zack_Mullock"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zack_Mullock","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Zack_Mullock","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zack_Mullock?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Zack_Mullock"}},"extract":"Zachary Mullock is an American politician. He is the Representative-Elect for New Jersey's 2nd congressional district, having ousted Republican incumbent Jeff Van Drew. He has a bachelor's from Mount Saint Mary's University and a Master of Business Administration from Saint Joseph's University. He succeeded as Chuck Lear as the mayor of Cape May on January 1, 2021. As the mayor of Cape May, he built a new fire house, library, community center, and theater, as well as a new police station and a few other things.","extract_html":"<p><b>Zachary Mullock</b> is an American politician. He is the Representative-Elect for New Jersey's 2nd congressional district, having ousted Republican incumbent Jeff Van Drew. He has a bachelor's from Mount Saint Mary's University and a Master of Business Administration from Saint Joseph's University. He succeeded as Chuck Lear as the mayor of Cape May on January 1, 2021. As the mayor of Cape May, he built a new fire house, library, community center, and theater, as well as a new police station and a few other things.</p>"}